  "body": "## [0.19.4] - 2026-11-23\n\n### Fixed\n- Start gitpane in remote and standalone Herdr Core terminals when the local desktop CLI or socket is unavailable. ([#274](https://github.com/affromero/gitpane/pull/274), closes [#273](https://github.com/affromero/gitpane/issues/273)) Thanks @expoli for reporting and fixing this.\n- Keep the current repository selected while scrolling and remember expanded submodule groups across restarts. ([#272](https://github.com/affromero/gitpane/pull/272), closes [#271](https://github.com/affromero/gitpane/issues/271))\n\n---\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/affromero/gitpane/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n",
